  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Tarawa Renewable Energy Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The South Tarawa Renewable Energy Project (STREP or the Project) will support upscaling of solar power generation in Kiribati. The Project will reduce dependence on fossil fuel imports by increasing the renewable energy (RE) percentage of electricity generation. STREP has three outputs: (i) solar photovoltaic and battery energy storage system installed; (ii) draft energy act to enable increased deployment of renewable energy developed; and (iii) institutional capacity for inclusive renewable energy project development and implementation enhanced.</narrative>
  </description>
